{
  "name": "Cleave",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Once per turn when you hit a creature with this weapon, you can also deal damage equal to your STR or DEX (your choice) to any other creature that is within range of your attack and within 5 ft of the original target, provided that your Attack Roll would've also hit these targets. This damage is doubled if the Attack Roll was a critical hit.</p><p>If the attack reduced the original target to 0 hitpoints, you add the excess damage to cleave's effect on one of the additional targets.</p>",
